3,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"3處獨立位置，3個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-sanguozhi-063-wufan"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_reading_cases":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-063-wufan:line025:reading-000-246","kind":"received_sentence","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-063-wufan:line025","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":246,"source_quote":"範爲人剛直，頗好自稱，然與親故交接有終始。素與魏滕同邑相善。滕嘗有罪，權責怒甚嚴，敢有諫者死，範謂滕曰：「與汝偕死。」滕曰：「死而無益，何用死爲？」範曰：「安能慮此坐觀汝邪？」乃髡頭自縛詣門下，使鈴下以聞。鈴下不敢，曰：「必死，不敢白。」範曰：「汝有子邪？」曰：「有。」曰：「使汝爲吳範死，子以屬我。」鈴下曰：「諾。」乃排閤入。言未卒，權大怒，欲便投以戟。逡巡走出，範因突入，叩頭流血，言與涕並。良久，權意釋，乃免滕。滕見範謝曰：「父母能生長我，不能免我於死。丈夫相知，如汝足矣，何用多爲！」","person_id":"v27_nrq_ppt","related_person_ids":["ntv_ei7_aqh","572_278_cba"],"reading":"吳範救魏滕。鈴下與其子未著名，不以對話的子、父母接入範氏。","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-063-wufan","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-063-wufan"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-063-wufan:line025-pei01-01:reading-000-091","kind":"annotation_sentence","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-063-wufan:line025-pei01-01","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":91,"source_quote":"《會稽典錄》曰：滕字周林，祖父河內太守朗，字少英，列在八俊。滕性剛直，行不苟合，雖遭困偪，終不迴撓。初亦迕策，幾殆，賴太妃救得免，語見《妃嬪傳》。歷歷山、潘陽、山陰三縣令，鄱陽太守。","person_id":"v27_nrq_ppt","related_person_ids":["199_2as_snw","e9c_070_567"],"reading":"祖父魏朗字少英；太妃救魏滕見吳夫人傳，彼作魏騰。數位校模板呈歷山、潘陽，另載建議歷陽、鄱陽。","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-063-wufan","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-063-wufan"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-wu063-wufan-2","subject_person_id":"v27_nrq_ppt","object_person_id":"199_2as_snw","predicate":"grandfather","qualifiers":{"source_term":"祖父河內太守朗"}